        "eyebrow": "How it works",
        "heading": "Old fence to finished wall.",
        "heading_size": "h0",
        "text": "<p>Four steps, and only two of them are yours. Here is what happens to a board between the fence line and your living room.</p>",
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/dr-install-hands.jpg",
