        "text": "<p>All the character of authentic reclaimed wood without turning your weekend project into a construction project.</p><p>Professional adhesive backing, applied in our shop. Best over clean, flat, primed drywall — and worth testing on a sample first, because a wall painted three times behaves differently to one that never was.</p>",
